    "detailed_description": "Amazing Weekend: Search and Relax offers a variety of unique and compelling mini-games, hidden-object puzzles, and more! Complete games to unlock new levels and explore interesting new locations where you\u2019ll go hiking, horseback riding, boating, and relaxing through a weekend of recreation! Take a break from the daily hustle and bustle with this incredible new way to relax and get inspired!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n* Explore twelve additional levels bursting with hidden objects and mini-games!<br />\r\n* Download beautiful wallpapers to stay inspired every day of the week!<br />\r\n* Bring the adventure home with the exclusive music player!<br />\r\n* Visit the shop to view trophies and souvenirs from your weekend!",
    "about_the_game": "Amazing Weekend: Search and Relax offers a variety of unique and compelling mini-games, hidden-object puzzles, and more! Complete games to unlock new levels and explore interesting new locations where you\u2019ll go hiking, horseback riding, boating, and relaxing through a weekend of recreation! Take a break from the daily hustle and bustle with this incredible new way to relax and get inspired!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n* Explore twelve additional levels bursting with hidden objects and mini-games!<br />\r\n* Download beautiful wallpapers to stay inspired every day of the week!<br />\r\n* Bring the adventure home with the exclusive music player!<br />\r\n* Visit the shop to view trophies and souvenirs from your weekend!",
